<tr><td class="rank">4</td><td>Fix the dead #cookbook TOC anchor and land the cookbook (mini-fridge teaser) on the landing page; unify the two recipe data models</td><td>The contents page must tell the truth; best-crafted object on the site is currently unreachable by its own front door</td><td>2, 1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="rank">5</td><td>Volume abstraction (vol-01 content file + currentVolume pointer + archive URL decision) before any Vol. 02 authoring begins</td><td>Every month of delay multiplies the migration cost; this is the scale-to-12 gate</td><td>9</td></tr>
<tr><td class="rank">6</td><td>Fold arrival/session choreography, surfaced memory (streaks, last room), Golden Hour rebuilt as an earned, persistent sixth world, and the Vantage-vs-Fold naming resolved</td><td>This is what converts a good tool into the bookmarkable premium object the brief demands</td><td>3</td></tr>
<tr><td class="rank">7</td><td>Feature hygiene: remove all placeholder tiles from DreamAsia, add "The Turn" narrative beat, codify the 4-beat + modules feature template for Vol. 02</td><td>The flagship story currently ships visibly unfinished; the template decision blocks next volume's authoring</td><td>6</td></tr>
<tr><td class="rank">8</td><td>Landing re-weighting: thesis line on the cover, TOC/spine visible by default (left-rail spine on desktop), middle-third hierarchy, horizontal Off-the-Clock shelf</td><td>First-read comprehension and the two signature scroll mechanics, in one coordinated layout pass</td><td>4, 5, 1</td></tr>
<tr><td class="rank">9</td><td>Bring Dev and Design toolkits to the instrument standard (Prompt Mixer, Poster Bench); replace mShots with self-hosted toolshots; add "Also in the kit" cross-references</td><td>Closes the visible quality gap against Music and removes a third-party dependency that will rot</td><td>7</td></tr>
<tr><td class="rank">10</td><td>Performance and asset pass: dynamic-import the loader (drop three.js from the landing path), compress VOL1 video, delete dead fonts, gate the brand-guide PDF</td><td>Largest wins for mobile first-load; the PDF becomes a capture asset instead of dead weight</td><td>9, 10</td></tr>
