<p class="meta">Deferred beyond the top 10, in rough order: the "selection" heading motif and Plate numbering system (section 1), Vue mascot commission and marginalia, the Video/Film toolkit with the Light Bench (target Vol. 02 or 03), Brand Kit "reveal" preview and shareable kit links, cookbook pull gesture and synthesized sounds, chef-of-the-volume and submission form, time-of-day tuning in The Fold, and the publishing runbook (which should in practice be written alongside item 5).</p>

